[I] Supports client-side web programming in Haskell

[T] HTTP is a Haskell library for client-side HTTP. It sets up connections,
[T] transmits requests and processes responses, offering a basic API for
[T] single requests and a session-level BrowserAction monad handling
[T] persistent connections, proxies, cookies and authentication.

[U] https://github.com/haskell/HTTP

